{"version":1,"content":"<p>TrendForce集邦諮詢昨日發佈分析稱，蘋果首款摺疊機iPhone Duo開放預購不到一周，官網部分訂單交期已推遲至2027年1月。首波用户反饋顯示，摺疊機展開後的分屏操作與屏幕觀感獲肯定，但App黑邊、按鍵配置及指紋解鎖增加了適應成本；屏幕損壞回報與高額維修報價，則將市場焦點引向可靠性與持有成本。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584292.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.855840+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:45:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"60991c6859772e98cf85c84f4beefe4125302daf7d3a146d0a8a1c53283d8c95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}